{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRUSH YOUR OPPONENTS AND BE THE MASTER OF THE ARENA! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall The Ball is a fun 2D party game played from 2 to 4 players in which victory is all that matters! A giant ball is in the arena, your goal: send it to your opponents! Get the most points before the time runs out and dominate the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AN UNCONTROLLABLE BALL!</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball only bounces around the edges of the arena and never stops! The more you hit it, the faster it will go! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PLAY CRAZY CHARACTERS : THE DEMINIS !</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you prefer brute force, magic or a car? That, we let you decide. What is certain is that each Demini have their own abilities!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2946840?t=1752164123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2946840?t=1752164123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946840/8088136def19648923728308a775b56eec0d9b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752164123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946840/8088136def19648923728308a775b56eec0d9b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752164123","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"f